<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers - Select to Choice 2-4 1100-1350 lbs 67.00-69.00. Load mostly Choice 70.00. Select 64.00-67.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers - Select and Choice 2-4 1000-1200 lbs 67.00-69.00. Select 64.00-67.00.</p>
</text>
